                                "sense_id": "65786666-2f2f-3e99-aee8-089dc2e45baf",
                                "text": "In our charity fundraiser called \"Walk for Wellness\", Stacy outwalked all other participants, racking up 37 kilometers in 3 weeks."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "88497bba-9fbf-478b-988c-24a904e2305b",
                                "sense_id": "65786666-2f2f-3e99-aee8-089dc2e45baf",
                                "text": "Mr. Seeger has walked the walk for so long that he has outwalked most everybody who would ever want to beat him up, throw bricks at him or denounce him as a Red."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f870e521-a03e-314f-830c-f342e1f9b138",
